WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.334 --> 00:00:12.847
Mom and Dad were busy getting ready for the trip.

2
00:00:12.848 --> 00:00:15.187
Hana: What are you doing, Mom?

3
00:00:15.188 --> 00:00:17.787
Mom: I'm wrapping some gifts.

4
00:00:17.788 --> 00:00:19.739
Hana: Who are they for?

5
00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:23.076
Mom: They are for Grandma.

6
00:00:23.077 --> 00:00:24.871
Hana: Can I help you?

7
00:00:24.874 --> 00:00:26.460
Mom: Sure, you can.

8
00:00:26.461 --> 00:00:28.412
Bring me the ribbon.

9
00:00:28.413 --> 00:00:32.142
Hana: Here you go.

10
00:00:32.143 --> 00:00:37.253
Mom: Thanks. By the way, have you tried on your party dress?

11
00:00:37.254 --> 00:00:40.586
Hana: I did. It still fits me well.

12
00:00:40.587 --> 00:00:42.376
Should I put it on?

13
00:00:42.377 --> 00:00:47.328
Mom: Yes. I would like to see it just in case.

14
00:00:47.329 --> 00:00:48.979
Hana: How do I look?

15
00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:51.722
Mom: Oh, you look so wonderful.

16
00:00:51.723 --> 00:00:56.271
Take it off now, and save it for the party.

17
00:00:56.272 --> 00:00:58.890
Hana: What about Bada and Hada?

18
00:00:58.891 --> 00:01:01.563
Mom: I have to buy a new suit for Bada.

19
00:01:01.564 --> 00:01:05.468
Hada can wear Bada's old one.

20
00:01:05.469 --> 00:01:08.322
Do you have fancy party clothes?

21
00:01:08.323 --> 00:01:10.992
I love the color of mine.

22
00:01:10.993 --> 00:01:15.885
I can't wait to see Bada and Hada wearing their suits.
